{"v":4,"catch":"掌握使用水彈打敗\" Fire Demon \"！","desc":"《Liquid Kids》是TAITO於1990年推出的動作遊戲。控制河馬部落的年輕英雄Hipopo，與Fire Demon戰鬥，保護和平的Woody-Lake。 一場充滿危險與刺激的冒險才剛剛開始。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-12-02","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d72deff0dc9a911baaf2afdb9d68b5941da49171d52215d007dc81a4ba0008ee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1161a04d333d47613f88c9a6932fc8bcf2a6aaab4a9f9ae6ea20f6823711d41a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/43f560c92d02a6e0805e10de8107c4a92de50f64200d30234096bb09a84c8e85.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6a9619ae2e75bbc34da9f75ba687e08317f28bd1dbbfe0d6576c91ec13336a22.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a755a0e3af97a0e3963dfb94f47dea2022c1da836fc696c2e387f5af78d4adc0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5e7a907d6c3dc9dfe655e6023221cd586a1678043c080dd54a8e822125bed05d.jpg"],"titleId":"01009e7013b2a000","dlc":[]}